### Upload report.txt (v1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/blobs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY
--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="report.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is the original project report.
--BOUNDARY--

### List blobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blobs

### Download current
GET http://localhost:8080/api/blobs/report.txt/download
